OL,3,GNEWSAMore prisoners, more violence:
OL,4,AInside Maghaberry's assault surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssaults at Northern Ireland's largest
OL,7,Fprison have more than doubled in the
OL,8,Fpast four years as prison officers warn
OL,9,Fof growing pressure behind the walls.
OL,11,FThere were 149 recorded assaults at
OL,12,FMaghaberry Prison last year, compared
OL,13,Fto 69 in 2021 - an increase of 116%.
OL,15,FThe Prison Officers' Association (POA)
OL,16,Fsaid rising prisoner numbers were
OL,17,Fhaving a knock-on effect on both staff
OL,18,Fand prisoners.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
