OL,3,GNEWSAMore prisoners, more violence:
OL,4,AInside Maghaberry's assault surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FIvor Dunne, chairman of the POA, said
OL,7,Fthe threat facing prison officers
OL,8,Fremained "serious", adding that
OL,9,Fprisoners may not remember who the
OL,10,Farresting officer was but that they
OL,11,F"will remember the person that unlocks
OL,12,Fyou every morning and locks you up at
OL,13,Fnight".
